# Toolbar: hover, undo on a dirty tree, stash, pop, refresh, and the avatars toggle. The stash commit
# SHA is stable because the harness fixes the commit date.
fixture demo
wait text "Working Changes"
move 54 1
snapshot hover-fetch
click 79 1
snapshot undo-refused
mask 0 47 160 1
click 87 1
wait text "WIP on main"
snapshot stashed
click 96 1
wait text "Working Changes (6"
snapshot popped
click 103 1
snapshot refreshed
click 154 1
snapshot avatars-toggled
